n.com/linux/v6.7-rc7/source/drivers/media/cec/core/cec-adap.c#L930">https:/=
/elixir.bootlin.com/linux/v6.7-rc7/source/drivers/media/cec/core/cec-adap.c=
#L930</a>).</p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal">For =93WARNING in cec_data_cancel=94, it is an inter=
nal warning used in cec_data_cancel (<a href=3D"https://elixir.bootlin.com/=
linux/v6.7-rc7/source/drivers/media/cec/core/cec-adap.c#L365">https://elixi=
r.bootlin.com/linux/v6.7-rc7/source/drivers/media/cec/core/cec-adap.c#L365<=
/a>),
 which checks whether the transmit is the current or pending. Unfortunately=
