he report and log.</p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal">For =93INFO: task hung in cec_claim_log_addrs=94, th=
e kernel hangs when the cec device ` wait_for_completion(&amp;adap-&gt;conf=
ig_completion);` (<a href=3D"https://elixir.bootlin.com/linux/v6.7-rc7/sour=
